- (SPIRIT NEIGHS)

495
00:30:25.073 --> 00:30:27.241
You can break easy
or you can break hard, mustang!

496
00:30:27.367 --> 00:30:28.409
(NICKERING)

497
00:30:28.619 --> 00:30:30.536
